  "description": "With stylish four-piece, 4130 chromoly front triangle, and killer colorways,the Legion L80 is an adult BMX bike that's hard to beat. Ideal for riders 5'6\" to 6'. Get the best in BMX-style bikes with the Legion L80.\nMongoose 4130 Chromoly front triangle and mid BB shell.\nDrivetrain features 175 mm 3-piece tubular chromoly hollow spindle cranks with a 25T steel chainring and mid sealed bearing bottom bracket.\n20” x 2.3” tires mounted on wide aluminum single wall 36H rims with 3/8” in axle front hub and 9T cog sealed bearing cassette rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar and fork, 50 mm stem, threadless sealed integrated headset, and aluminum U-brake and brake levers.\n20.75” top tube length. Suggested rider height is 5’6” - 6'0\".",
